---
import { SITE_MEDIA } from '../data/siteMedia';
---

<section class="hub-section final">
  <div class="band">
    <h2>Mach's besser als die Konkurrenz - mit uns.</h2>
    <a class="cta" href="/booking">Jetzt starten</a>
  </div>

  <div class="founder">
    <img src={SITE_MEDIA.about} alt="Matthew Phillips" loading="lazy" />
    <p class="name">Matthew Phillips</p>
    <p class="role">Founder, MVP Media</p>
    <h3>Lass uns durchstarten!</h3>
    <p class="copy">Wenn du Ergebnisse statt Ausreden willst, starten wir dein Projekt strukturiert und ohne Reibung.</p>
    <a class="cta" href="/booking">Projekt anfragen</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .final { margin: 1rem 0 0; }
  .band {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a, #0e0e0e);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 1.2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    max-width: 15ch;
  }
  .cta {
    width: fit-content;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #171717;
    background: #ff8da1;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.95rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .founder {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    background: #101010;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 1.4rem 1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .founder img {
    width: 84px;
    height: 84px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 3px solid #ff8da1;
    margin: 0 auto 0.55rem;
  }
  .name { margin: 0; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }
  .role { margin: 0.15rem 0 0.8rem; color: #a6a6a6; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; color: #fff; font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .copy { margin: 0 auto 0.85rem; max-width: 52ch; color: #b2b2b2; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .band { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
